# With the special meter full, a diagonal pressed on the keyboard (D, then S two ticks later, both held)
# and J is the Varial Heelflip, not the Kickflip Superman (Right, Down + J): two keys gone down within
# tricks.dirTicks of each other and still held are one diagonal, not a sequence. Released between
# (lab-special: Right, then Down, then J) it is the special.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
cmd 0 set skater.special 1
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold right 94..99
hold down 96..99
tap flip 97
run 320
expect event trickStart{trick=Varial Heelflip} within 98..98
expect no event trickStart{trick=Kickflip Superman}
expect event comboLanded{name=Varial Heelflip} within 160..240
expect no event bail
